<title>GERMANY: Adidas 1996 profit moves higher.</title>
<headline>Adidas 1996 profit moves higher.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   360     vs 243</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share		 6.93    vs 5.40 marks</p>
<p>    Group sales				  4,709   vs 3,500</p>
<p>    Dividend				     1.10 mark/share</p>
<p>    proposed</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German sports retail group is Adidas AG. It said it made a fourth quarter operating loss of 17 million marks, compared to a loss last time of 33 million, on fourth quarter sales that rose to 995 million marks from 659 million marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
